<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Your LaunchTrace Food sample</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;background:#f5f5f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1c1917;">
<div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;">
  <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#78716c;">LaunchTrace Food</p>
  <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;">Your sample feed</h1>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Hello{% if contact_name %} {{ contact_name }}{% endif %},</p>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
    Here's a recent LaunchTrace Food sample — {{ total }} emerging UK food brands identified from
    newly published trade mark activity, verified against Companies House and scored for how
    early-stage they look.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
    The CSV is attached. Columns most relevant to a {{ supplier_type_label or 'supplier' }} like
    {{ company }} are the relevance bands — they indicate what a brand at this stage typically
    needs, not that they are currently buying.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
    If it's useful, founding access is £{{ '%.2f'|format(price_pence/100) }} a month with no contract:
    <a href="{{ subscribe_url }}" style="color:#0369a1;">start a subscription</a>.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top:24px;font-size:12px;color:#78716c;">
    Source: UK Intellectual Property Office and Companies House data under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
    You received this because you requested a sample at {{ site_url }}.
    <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color:#78716c;">Opt out</a>.
  </p>
</div></body></html>
